Table full name: bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.repositories
Column name: id Type: INT64 Description: he unique primary key of the repository in the Libraries.io database.
Column name: host_type Type: STRING Description: Which website the repository is hosted on either GitHub GitLab or Bitbucket.
Column name: name_with_owner Type: STRING Description: The repository name and owner seperated by a slash also maps to the url slug on the given repository host e.g. librariesio/libraries.io.
Column name: description Type: STRING Description: Description of repository.
Column name: fork Type: BOOL Description: Is the repository a fork of another.
Column name: created_timestamp Type: TIMESTAMP Description: Timestamp of when the repository was created on the host.
Column name: updated_timestamp Type: TIMESTAMP Description: Timestamp of when the repository was last saved by Libraries.io.
Column name: last_pushed_timestamp Type: TIMESTAMP Description: Timestamp of when the repository was last pushed to only available for GitHub repositories.
Column name: homepage_url Type: STRING Description: URL of a declared homepage or other website for the repository.
Column name: size Type: INT64 Description: Size of the repository in kilobytes only available for GitHub and Bitbucket.
Column name: stars_count Type: INT64 Description: Number of stars on the repository only available for GitHub and GitLab.
Column name: language Type: STRING Description: Primary programming language the project is written in only available for GitHub and Bitbucket.
Column name: issues_enabled Type: BOOL Description: Is the bug tracker enabled for this repository?.
Column name: wiki_enabled Type: BOOL Description: Is the wiki enabled for this repository?.
Column name: pages_enabled Type: BOOL Description: Is GitHub pages enabled for this repository? only possible for GitHub.
Column name: forks_count Type: INT64 Description: Number of forks of this repository.
Column name: mirror_url Type: STRING Description: URL of the repositroy of which this is a mirror of only present if this repository is a mirror of another.
Column name: open_issues_count Type: INT64 Description: Number of open issues on the repository bug tracker only available for GitHub and GitLab.
Column name: default_branch Type: STRING Description: Primary branch of the repository.
Column name: watchers_count Type: INT64 Description: Number of subscribers to all notifications for the repository only available for GitHub and Bitbucket.
Column name: uuid Type: STRING Description: ID of the repository on the remote host not unique between GitLab and GitHub repositories.
Column name: fork_source_name_with_owner Type: STRING Description: If the repository is a fork the repository name and owner seperated by a slash of the repository if was forked from.
Column name: license Type: STRING Description: SPDX identifier of the license of the repository only available for GitHub repositories.
Column name: contributors_count Type: INT64 Description: Number of unique contributors that have committed to the default branch.
Column name: readme_filename Type: STRING Description: If a readme file has been detected the full name of the readme file e.g README.md.
Column name: changelog_filename Type: STRING Description: If a changelog file has been detected the full name of the changelog file e.g changelog.txt.
Column name: contributing_guidelines_filename Type: STRING Description: If a contributing guidelines file has been detected the full name of the contributing guidelines file e.g contributing.md.
Column name: license_filename Type: STRING Description: If a license file has been detected the full name of the license file e.g LICENSE.
Column name: code_of_conduct_filename Type: STRING Description: If a code of conduct file has been detected the full name of the code of conduct file e.g code_of_conduct.md.
Column name: security_threat_model_filename Type: STRING Description: If a Security Threat Model file has been detected the full name of the Security Threat Model file e.g threatmodel.md.
Column name: security_audit_filename Type: STRING Description: If a Security Audit file has been detected the full name of the Security Audit file e.g security.md.
Column name: status Type: STRING Description: Either Active Deprecated Unmaintained Help Wanted Removed no value also means active. Updated when detected by Libraries.io or su. manually by Libraries.io user via "repo suggection" feature.
Column name: last_synced_timestamp Type: TIMESTAMP Description: Timestamp of when Libraries.io last synced the repository from the host API.
Column name: sourcerank Type: INT64 Description: Libraries.io defined score based on quality popularity and community metrics.
Column name: display_name Type: STRING Description: Display name for the repository only available for GitLab repositories.
Column name: scm_type Type: STRING Description: Type of source control repository uses always "git" for GitHub and GitLab.
Column name: pull_requests_enabled Type: STRING Description: Are pull requests enabled for this repository? Only available for GitLab repositories.
Column name: logo_url Type: STRING Description: Custom logo url for repository only available for GitLab repositories.
Column name: keywords Type: STRING Description: Comma separated array of keywords called "topics" on GitHub only available for GitHub and GitLab.
Column name: an Type: STRING Description: 
