Column name: optional_dependency Type: STRING Description: Is the dependency optional?.
Column name: dependency_requirements Type: STRING Description: The version or range of versions that the dependency specifies, resolution of that to a particular version is package manager specific.
Column name: dependency_project_id Type: INT64 Description: The unique primary key of the project for this dependency in the Libraries.io database.
